-- V1 -- baseline for matching-service. Creates nothing, deliberately.
--
-- DO NOT EDIT THIS FILE. Flyway checksums migration files byte for byte, and this one
-- is entirely comments -- so even a typo fix here changes its checksum and every start
-- against an already-migrated database then fails validation with "Migration checksum
-- mismatch for version 1", taking every integration test down with it at context
-- startup. Rationale that invites revision lives in README.md beside this file, where
-- it can be edited freely. Migrations are append-only: add V2, never touch V1.
